Z||000016||theogre||04-29-99||09:38 PM||||call 1800PMCARES to verify your VIN. If any outstanding work is refused by the Any dealer, call Pontiac again, get the address to file a formal complaint with pontiac. Dealers Must perform any outstanding recall work. It is NOT up to the dealer to decide. <p>If you have over 100Kmiles or it's metric equivalent, then you can also request the quaint plastic frame for your tag. (available shaped to fit U.S. tags only as far as I know)<p>If a dealer refuses to perform recall work I think U.S. readers can also file a complaint with NHTSA.  <A HREF="http://www.nhtsa.dot.gov/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.nhtsa.dot.gov/</A> 
